==  Sphere of the Zodiac - Masloth  ==

The second Sephirah, Chokmah, is the Sphere of the Zodiac, or fixed stars. In the ''Lesser Holy Assembly''<ref name="ch201" />, from Chokmah comes ''mezla'' ({{Hebrew text|&#x05de;&#x05d6;&#x05dc;&#x05d0;}}), plural ''masloth''({{Hebrew text|&#x05de;&#x05d6;&#x05dc;&#x05d5;&#x05ea;}}), to refer to the order and arrangement of the constellations or zodiac, Galgal ha-Masloth ({{Hebrew text|&#x05d2;&#x05dc;&#x05d2;&#x05dc; &#x05d4;-&#x05de;&#x05d6;&#x05dc;&#x05d5;&#x05ea;}}). [Hebrew doesn’t use hypens. I added here to clarify the Heh ({{Hebrew text|&#x05d4;}}) means “the.”]

==  Notes  ==

